  The reel_script and caption say the 23rd-day programme includes 'Prasanthi flag hoisting' and 'Rudra parayanam' in the morning section, which matches, but the slides_spec 'பிறந்தநாள்' slide lists 'மாலை ஊஞ்சல் உற்சவம், மங்கள ஆரத்தி' correctly; however the caption's 'Sai Mandir' location is stated as the venue for all events while the article only says the events are held at the Sai Mandir complex (acceptable), so no error there.
  The caption says the 23rd events include 'நகர சங்கீர்த்தனம்' listed under the morning programme, which is correct, but the caption also lists the 22nd-day 101 Naam Sankeerthana Bhajan at 8 AM as a fact mixed with the Narayana Seva meal preparation without clarifying times consistently; this is a sentence-merging issue, not a factual error.
  The slides_spec for 'நிகழ்ச்சிகள்' omits the 22nd-day 'நாராயண சேவை' as a separate item from the 101 Naam Sankeerthanam and merges two different events into one line ('மதியம் 2 மணிக்கு நாராயண சேவை உணவு தயாரிப்பு' is separate, but line 'நவம்பர் 22ம் தேதி காலை 8 மணிக்கு 101 நாம சங்கீர்த்தனம்' drops 'பஜன'), a minor wording deviation.
  The reel_script omits the 'சிறப்பு சொற்பொழிவு' wording change to 'சொற்பொழிவு' and omits the 'பிரசாந்தி கொடியேற்றம' from the 23rd-day sequence in the slide content, so the slides do not fully reflect the article's list.
